{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38878","headline":"书事投所知 · 杜荀鹤","name":"书事投所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古陌寒风来去吹，马蹄尘旋上麻衣。\n虽然干禄无休意，争奈趋时不见机。\n诗思趁云从岳涌，乡心随鴈遶湖飞。\n肯将骨肉轻离别，未遇人知未得归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}